msgid "Tools"
msgstr "Strumenti"

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:253
msgid "General"
msgstr "Generale"

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:268
#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:374
msgid "Toolbar Customize"
msgstr "Personalizza barra strumenti"

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:271
#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:505
msgid "Show Hotkeys"
msgstr "Mostra scorciatoie"

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:280
msgid "STEP Import"
msgstr "Importazione STEP"

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:288
msgid "Angular Deflection"
msgstr "Deflessione angolare"

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:293
msgid ""
"Maximum angle between the surface normal and the normal of a generated "
"triangle. Smaller values give a more precise but heavier mesh."
msgstr ""
"Angolo massimo tra la normale della superficie e la normale di un triangolo "
"generato. Valori più piccoli producono una mesh più precisa ma più pesante."

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:297
#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:298
msgid "Linear Deflection"
msgstr "Deflessione lineare"

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:304
msgid ""
"Maximum distance between the exact surface and a generated triangle. Smaller "
"values give a more precise but heavier mesh."
msgstr ""
"Distanza massima tra la superficie esatta e un triangolo generato. Valori "
"più piccoli producono una mesh più precisa ma più pesante."

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:308
msgid "Relative Deflection"
msgstr "Deflessione relativa"

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:310
msgid ""
"Treat the linear deflection as a fraction of the edge size instead of an "
"absolute distance."
msgstr ""
"Tratta la deflessione lineare come una frazione della dimensione dello "
"spigolo invece che come una distanza assoluta."

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:312
msgid "Auto Colorize"
msgstr "Colora automaticamente"

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:314
msgid ""
"Assign distinct colors to the imported components. Has no effect if the STEP "
"file already contains colors."
msgstr ""
"Assegna colori distinti ai componenti importati. Non ha effetto se il file "
"STEP contiene già dei colori."

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:316
msgid "Force Load Sub-Shapes"
msgstr "Forza caricamento sotto-forme"

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:318
msgid ""
"Always load the bodies (solids and shells) of a shape as separate child "
"objects, even if the shape has a single body."
msgstr ""
"Carica sempre i corpi (solidi e gusci) di una forma come oggetti figli "
"separati, anche se la forma ha un solo corpo."

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:327
msgid "Global"
msgstr "Globale"

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:329
msgid "Reset Settings"
msgstr "Reimposta impostazioni"

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:340
msgid "Interface"
msgstr "Interfaccia"

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:349
msgid "UI Scale"
msgstr "Scala UI"

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:358
msgid "Save Tool Window Positions"
msgstr "Salva posizioni delle finestre degli strumenti"

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:359
msgid ""
"If checked then enables using of saved positions of tool windows in the "
"config file"
msgstr ""
"Se selezionato, abilita l'uso delle posizioni salvate delle finestre degli "
"strumenti nel file di configurazione"

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:369
msgid "Enable multi-windows"
msgstr "Abilita finestre multiple"

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:371
msgid ""
"Allow tool windows to be moved outside the main window. To apply the "
"changes, need to restart the application."
msgstr ""
"Consente di spostare le finestre degli strumenti fuori dalla finestra "
"principale. Per applicare le modifiche è necessario riavviare l'applicazione."

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:377
msgid "Behavior"
msgstr "Comportamento"

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:385
msgid "Make Visible on Select"
msgstr "Rendi visibile alla selezione"

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:388
msgid "Deselect on Hide"
msgstr "Deseleziona al nascondere"

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:394
msgid "Close Context Menu on Click"
msgstr "Chiudi menu contestuale al clic"

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:397
msgid "Close scene context menu on any change or click outside"
msgstr "Chiudi il menu contestuale della scena ad ogni modifica o clic esterno"

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:401
msgid "Auto Close Previous Tool"
msgstr "Chiudi automaticamente lo strumento precedente"

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:404
msgid ""
"Automatically close blocking tool when another blocking tool is activated"
msgstr ""
"Chiude automaticamente uno strumento bloccante quando ne viene attivato un "
"altro"

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:406
msgid "Sort Dropped Files"
msgstr "Ordina i file trascinati"

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:409
msgid ""
"Whether to sort the filenames received from Drag&Drop in lexicographical "
"order before adding them in scene"
msgstr ""
"Indica se ordinare i nomi dei file ricevuti tramite Drag&Drop in ordine "
"lessicografico prima di aggiungerli alla scena"

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:411
msgid "Show Experimental Features"
msgstr "Mostra funzionalità sperimentali"

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:412
msgid "Show experimental or diagnostic tools and controls"
msgstr "Mostra strumenti e controlli sperimentali o diagnostici"

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:419
msgid "Notifications"
msgstr "Notifiche"

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:421
msgid "Time Reports"
msgstr "Report temporali"

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:431
msgid "Show duration of last operation of the application."
msgstr "Mostra la durata dell'ultima operazione dell'applicazione."

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:433
msgid "Recommendations"
msgstr "Raccomandazioni"

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:443
msgid "Show notifications with recommended actions."
msgstr "Mostra notifiche con azioni consigliate."

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:445
msgid "Implicit Changes"
msgstr "Modifiche implicite"

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:455
msgid ""
"Notify when some changes were made implicitly by the application. (mostly "
"appear on import of non-manifold models)"
msgstr ""
"Notifica quando l'applicazione ha effettuato modifiche implicite. (compaiono "
"soprattutto all'importazione di modelli non manifold)"

